        "description": "Delete up to 500 contacts by id with {\"ids\": [...]}, or the whole audience with {\"confirm\": \"all\"} (optionally with status subscribed or unsubscribed). Not in Resend. Deleting the whole audience needs an owner or admin. Requires the contact:write scope.",
