        "description": "Emails an invitation link that is valid for 7 days. The person signs in with the invited address to accept. Inviting the same address again sends a fresh link. Needs a paid plan and a free seat. Limited to 20 invitations an hour per inviter and 3 an hour per address. Owner or admin only; requires the team:manage scope.",
